OL,3,AUkraine peace talks resume with 'some
OL,4,Aflexibility' by warring sides, US
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FMoscow and Kyiv are privately showing
OL,8,F"a little bit of flexibility" on the
OL,9,Fissue of who would control Ukraine's
OL,10,Feastern regions in a postwar scenario,
OL,11,FUS officials have said.
OL,13,FThe comments came as the three
OL,14,Fcountries prepared for the first
OL,15,Ftrilateral talks aimed at ending the
OL,16,Fwar in Ukraine since February.
OL,18,FSenior officials from Moscow, Kyiv and
OL,19,FWashington were due to meet in Abu
OL,20,FDhabi on Tuesday as the fifth
OL,21,Fanniversary of Russia's full-scale
OL,22,Finvasion of Ukraine approaches.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
