OL,3,AUkraine peace talks resume with 'some
OL,4,Aflexibility' by warring sides, US
OL,5,Aofficials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FJared Kushner - Donald Trump's
OL,8,Fson-in-law and part of the US
OL,9,Fdelegation alongside peace envoy Steve
OL,10,FWitkoff - said the talks would be
OL,11,Ffocused on addressing the "postwar
OL,12,Fsecurity concerns" of both Russia and
OL,13,FUkraine.
